{"version":1,"content":"<p>【Zen 6 APU 😱】跑分資料庫 OpenBenchmarking 近日出現一款規格相當罕見的 AMD 工程測試樣品（Engineering Sample，ES）晶片，該晶片代號為 Gainsborough 家族的 Zen 6 APU 處理器，搭配高達 24GB 的高階 LPDDR5 記憶體，外媒推測該處理器極可能是為 Valve 次世代 Steam Deck 2 而設。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.224767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:13:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:37:38.338582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:38.727344+00:00","content_hash":"aef6b054b9b13477db6cef422a389f6440697e01b13fd1e57c19a0e6a12c021a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}